{"strongs": "H4839", "word": "מָרָק", "translit": "ma.raq", "root": "מרק", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "juice stewed out of meat, or broth", "definition": "מָרָק ( van d. H מָרַק ) noun masculine juice stewed out of meat, or broth (on form compare Lag BN 50 ); — וְהַמָּרָק שָׂם בַּפָּרוּר Judg 6:19 (see GFM ); וְאֶתהַֿמָּרָק שְׁפוֺךְ v Judg 6:20 construct מְרַק Isa 65:4 Qr , so Vrss ( Kt פרק ) broth of unclean things. [ מֶרְקָח ], מֶרְקָחָה , מִרְקַ֫תַת see רקח .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4829')\">BDB4829</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4839')\">H4839</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4828')\">BDB4828</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4830')\">BDB4830</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מָרָק</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H</lookup> <bdbheb>מָרַק</bdbheb>) <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>juice stewed out of meat, or broth</highlightword> (on form compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 50</sup></lookup>); — <bdbheb>וְהַמָּרָק שָׂם בַּפָּרוּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,19)\">Judg 6:19</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup>); <bdbheb>וְאֶתהַֿמָּרָק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שְׁפוֺךְ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Judg 6:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,20)\">Judg 6:20</ref> construct <bdbheb>מְרַק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,4)\">Isa 65:4</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>פרק</bdbheb>) <highlight>broth</highlight> of unclean things. </p><hr><p>[<bdbheb>מֶרְקָח</bdbheb>], <bdbheb>מֶרְקָחָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִרְקַ֫תַת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>רק